      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Forging a protective suit out of pure, hyper-dense Dark Matter is exactly as ridiculous as it sounds. You are essentially wearing the gravitational fabric of the cosmos. It is virtually impenetrable, effortlessly shrugging off kinetic impacts, creeper explosions, and mob attacks that would instantly shatter the finest diamonds into dust. You are a walking, unbreakable anomaly of physics.\n\nFunctionally, this armor set provides a massive upgrade in sheer defensive stats and durability over standard Diamond armor. However, for a high-tech GregTech engineer, it comes with a slightly disappointing caveat: it is only armor. It has absolutely zero technological utility. There are no integrated jetpacks, no night vision goggles, no auto-feeders, and no EU storage. It won\u0027t help you fly or breathe underwater—but it will ensure you survive almost any physical trauma.",
